  "description": "Line 5's two tracks at Kapurbawdi, from OpenStreetMap (ways 1484919196 and 1484919198, read 2026-10-09), running from near Balkum through the curve and north beside Line 4, past Kapurbawdi station. MMRDA's alignment file stops at the curve and puts its 'Kapurbawdi' point on the curve, where there is no station (checked by the owner on Google Maps imagery and on Esri imagery, 2026-10-09). Read by scripts/build-alignment-line5.py, which joins the line midway between these tracks to MMRDA's line where they meet.",
